{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49553","headline":"女冠子 一 · 毛熙震","name":"女冠子 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧桃红杏，迟日媚笼光影，彩霞深。\n香暖熏莺语，风清引鹤音。\n翠鬟冠玉叶，霓袖捧瑶琴。\n应共吹箫侣，暗相寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛熙震","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49553.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49553","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}